  "prompt": "For each lead source, how many contacts reached each step of the 2024 sales funnel? Take the leads created in 2024 (created_at, Brussels local time); a contact counts under every source it had a 2024 lead from. A contact is one email address, compared exactly as stored. A contact counts as with_opportunity when one of its leads from that source has an opportunity, and as won when one of those opportunities is won. The steps need no date order: an opportunity counts whenever it was created, and a won one whenever it closed, even in a later year. Return four columns, in this order: source, contacts, with_opportunity and won, each count a number of contacts. Return one row for each source. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
